CTF Army Knife LOLBAS integration

Includes the Living Off The Land Binaries, Scripts and Libraries catalogue from
the LOLBAS Project (https://lolbas-project.github.io), curated by the LOLBAS
Project and its contributors.
LOLBAS is licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3.
https://github.com/LOLBAS-Project/LOLBAS

vendor/lolbas/ is a pinned, unmodified copy of the upstream yml/ entries and
the upstream LICENSE and NOTICE.md (see integration/lolbas/upstream.json for
the exact commit). The deprecated Archive-Old-Version/ tree is not included.
apps/web/lib/tools/lolbas/data.generated.ts is derived from them by
scripts/lolbas.mjs; entry text, commands and links are preserved verbatim.

Community modifications: the search and browsing interface is reimplemented in
the CTF Army Knife design system, with privilege requirements grouped for
filtering and command placeholders expanded to the same example values the
official site uses, optionally replaced by user-supplied URLs, paths and
commands. These modifications do not imply any endorsement by the original
authors.

